# Procfile for Railway deployment
# DO NOT include startup command - Railway uses the Start Command in dashboard settings
#
# To configure Railway:
# 1. Set Root Directory to: services/api
# 2. Leave Build Command EMPTY
# 3. Set Start Command to:
#    python -m uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port ${PORT:-8000}
#
# The ${PORT:-8000} syntax uses PORT from Railway env, or defaults to 8000 locally
